TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Aaa, senden bir{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} ricam var. {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
için bir hediye aldım ama
kendim{{TAG:0003:000D:}} götürmeye çekiniyorum.
Benim yerime {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}teslim eder misin? {{TAG:0005:0007:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}I borrowed something from
{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} a while back.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
And now I need to return it.
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}But it's been so long that I can't
do it face-to-face myself.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Would you do it for me?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Qualche anno fa, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
mi ha prestato questa cosa.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
E ora sarebbe il caso di ridargliela.
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Solo che è passato così tanto
tempo che mi vergogno di farlo.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
